 "about": "The album ask's test set (album-ask.ts): 60 album photos judged by eye on 14 Nov 2026, three sheets of 20. cut: the fish cut by the photo's own edge (cut), partly, or whole. small: true where the fish is too small to make out; \"clear\" where it fills a small part of the photo but can be made out; false where it is large. setup: a photo tank, dish, tray or a ruler beside it. scripts/album-ask-set.ts asks it again and counts.",
